  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Standards and Trade Development Facility, a global partnership of the Food and Agriculture Organization, the World Organisation for Animal Health, the World Bank, the World Health Organization and the World Trade Organization, builds the capacity of developing countries to implement international sanitary and phytosanitary (SPS) standards to gain and maintain international agricultural market access.</narrative>
